                                    "no": 17,
                                    "type": "ITINERARY",
                                    "note": "If you do not have a credit card in the lead drivers name and they will be using a debit card instead (accepted at many locations) please check your Vehicle car class.\n Only the below cars listed can be rented using a debit card;\n\nCar class A Chevrolet Spark or similar Economy car\nCar class B Nissan Versa or similar Compact car\nCar class C Toyota Corolla or similar Intermediate car\nCar class F Nissan Altima or similar Fullsize car\nCar class Q4 Ford Escape or similar Compact/small SUV\nThere are exceptions in Florida ONLY where debit cards can be used for the below car class in  additon to the above mentioned car class list;\nCar class R Chrysler Pacifica or similar MIni van\nCar class L Ford Edge or similar 5 passenger SUV\nCar class L4 Ford Explorer or similar 7 passenger SUV\n",
