                                    "notes": [
                                        {
                                            "no": 1,
                                            "type": "BOOKING",
                                            "note": "****USA RESORT TEAM CONTACT DETAILS****\n\nOur highly trained Resort Experts are always on hand to answer any questions you may have. If you encounter any problems or have a complaint, please let us know straight away so we can do our best to resolve things for you.\n\nContact us:\n\nFlorida & East Coast USA Cities\n Phone: +1 407 856 1177\n WhatsApp: +44 7360544350\n Email: USAreps@virginholidays.com\n 8am-8pm EST Mon-Sun\n\nCalls, WhatsApp's and Emails will be answered during these opening times.\n Please check with your phone company for costs of calling abroad.\n\nFlorida Virgin Atlantic Holidays Office:\n Marriott Village Service Centre \n8623 Vineland Ave Orlando FL 32821\n 8am-4pm EST Mon-Sat\n \n24 hour UK Emergency Support Line: +44 344 472 4920 or dutyoffice@virginholidays.com\n\nThis number is for out of hours emergencies where you are unable to reach our Resort Team and need urgent help, such as if there was an accident or illness, missed flight connections, or problems checking in for your flight/accommodation.\n\nPlease print and keep this contact card with your travel documents.",
                                            "systemGenerated": true,
                                            "noteId": 0
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "no": 2,
                                            "type": "INVOICE",
                                            "note": "****USA RESORT TEAM CONTACT DETAILS****\n\nOur highly trained Resort Experts are always on hand to answer any questions you may have. If you encounter any problems or have a complaint, please let us know straight away so we can do our best to resolve things for you.\n\nContact us:\n\nFlorida & East Coast USA Cities\n Phone: +1 407 856 1177\n WhatsApp: +44 7360544350\n Email: USAreps@virginholidays.com\n 8am-8pm EST Mon-Sun\n\nCalls, WhatsApp's and Emails will be answered during these opening times.\n Please check with your phone company for costs of calling abroad.\n\nFlorida Virgin Atlantic Holidays Office:\n Marriott Village Service Centre \n8623 Vineland Ave Orlando FL 32821\n 8am-4pm EST Mon-Sat\n \n24 hour UK Emergency Support Line: +44 344 472 4920 or dutyoffice@virginholidays.com\n\nThis number is for out of hours emergencies where you are unable to reach our Resort Team and need urgent help, such as if there was an accident or illness, missed flight connections, or problems checking in for your flight/accommodation.\n\nPlease print and keep this contact card with your travel documents.",
                                            "systemGenerated": true,
                                            "noteId": 0
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "no": 3,
                                            "type": "ITINERARY",
                                            "note": "****USA RESORT TEAM CONTACT DETAILS****\n\nOur highly trained Resort Experts are always on hand to answer any questions you may have. If you encounter any problems or have a complaint, please let us know straight away so we can do our best to resolve things for you.\n\nContact us:\n\nFlorida & East Coast USA Cities\n Phone: +1 407 856 1177\n WhatsApp: +44 7360544350\n Email: USAreps@virginholidays.com\n 8am-8pm EST Mon-Sun\n\nCalls, WhatsApp's and Emails will be answered during these opening times.\n Please check with your phone company for costs of calling abroad.\n\nFlorida Virgin Atlantic Holidays Office:\n Marriott Village Service Centre \n8623 Vineland Ave Orlando FL 32821\n 8am-4pm EST Mon-Sat\n \n24 hour UK Emergency Support Line: +44 344 472 4920 or dutyoffice@virginholidays.com\n\nThis number is for out of hours emergencies where you are unable to reach our Resort Team and need urgent help, such as if there was an accident or illness, missed flight connections, or problems checking in for your flight/accommodation.\n\nPlease print and keep this contact card with your travel documents.",
