                {
                    "no": 7,
                    "type": "RESERVATION",
                    "note": "LPAX CALLED,PASSED DPA,CUSTOMER WANTED TO UPGRADE HER CABIN TO UPPER CLASS BOTH WAYS. \n\nADDITIONAL £390.14+ \n\nCUSTOMER WENT AHEAD WITH THE CHANGE. CONFIRMED ITINERARY",
