                {
                    "no": 8,
                    "type": "RESERVATION",
                    "note": "Lead rang as son in  law as been put into end of life care. Wanted to move to 29Nov25. No hotels and tickets issued so checked and Elyse auth. Upper both ways was over 8K so quoted Premium out and Upper back£6272.51. Customer asked to go ahead. Suggested she call around 17 Jan when flights released and we can quote for Upper on o/b",
                    "displayName": "Samantha Shaw",
