                {
                    "no": 2,
                    "code": "Luggage allowance & Seating - all airlines",
                    "description": "Luggage allowance & Seating - all airlines",
                    "note": "Please note:  Airline luggage allowances can vary depending on whether you are \nflying on an international or domestic/internal flight.  Please ensure you check with \nthe airline you are booked on, for their luggage allowances and any relevant \ncharges.\n\nSeating with airlines can be chargeable and some require\ntickets to be issued before seating can be assigned. \nFor tickets to be issued we would require full payment to be made.\n\nOnce tickets are issued they are non changeable and non refundable.",
                    "dateModified": "2022-03-27T10:15:26",
