                    "description": "Credit Card Authorisations - World",
                    "note": "Many worldwide hotels and cruise lines will pre-authorise between $50 and $500\non your credit or debit card per room, per night for room charges (i.e room service).\n\nAt the end of your holiday,  the authorisation will be released but these funds may\nnot be available immediately.",
