                {
                    "no": 9,
                    "code": "Virgin Holidays Booking App",
                    "description": "Virgin Holidays Booking App",
                    "note": "You will now be able to view your booking on Manage My Booking via our\nwebsite where you can check out your itinerary, current invoices, make payments\nand download documents. \n\nDont forget you can also download the Virgin Holidays App via the Appstore or \nGoogle Play - your booking will be available to link with your app within 24 hours.\n\nIf you have booked through Virgin Holidays, either online, instore or over the \nphone then please head to https://www.virginholidays.co.uk/yourbooking/\n\nIf you have booked your flight + hotel, or flight+car through the \nVirgin Atlantic website then please head to \nhttps://travelplus.virginatlantic.com/yourbooking/",
                    "dateModified": "2021-09-02T12:56:51",
                    "external": true,
